{"id":"000W26","title":"Ninesweeper","author":"chy2018","solvedCount":2,"difficulty":3,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-11-15T22:55:28+00:00","posted":"Heute, 22:10 Uhr","rules":"This variant combines sudoku and minesweeper.\n\nPlay on SudokuPad\n\nFill the grid with the digits 0-9 such that the following constraints are satisfied.\n\n• Ninesweeper: Every digit from 0-8 is a clue which indicates the number of 9 adjacent to it (orthogonally and diagonally).\n\n• Sudoku: Clues (0-8) do not repeat in each row, column, and 3x3 box. 9 may repeat in rows, columns, and 3x3 boxes. (You may turn OFF the conflict checker in the settings.)\n\n• Dots: The cells separated by a black dot must have a ratio of 2. The cells separated by a white dot must have a difference of 1.\n\n• Arrow: The digits on the arrow must add up to the number in the circle.\n\n• Renban line: The lines in this puzzle are all Renban lines. The numbers on a Renban line must be a set of consecutive, non-repeating numbers distributed in any order along that line.\n\n• In this specific puzzle, the digit 8 does not appear anywhere.","solutionCode":"Row 8","tags":["Sudoku","Minesweeper"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/ut1dcmh0iu","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/ut1dcmh0iu","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","arrows","overlays","underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-15T22:55:28+00:00"}